#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Operations"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "The supporting work of running institutions: money, assets, entitlement schemes and safety. Often provided by generic systems and integrated rather than built."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Budget**: An approved allocation of money to an institution or function for a financial period. _Avoid_: Allocation (unless it is a distribution)"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Asset**: A durable item an institution holds and accounts for. _Avoid_: Equipment, inventory item"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Entitlement scheme**: A scheme that provides learners with a benefit under eligibility rules, such as meals, transport or a scholarship. _Avoid_: Programme (which means a course of education here), project"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Beneficiary**: A learner receiving an entitlement scheme's benefit during a period. _Avoid_: Recipient, participant"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/operations/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Incident**: A recorded event affecting the safety of learners or staff at a site. _Avoid_: Case, report"
msgstr ""
